<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's NLCF to seek 52,500T of feed wheat.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's NLCF to seek 52,500T of feed wheat.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's National Livestock Cooperatives Federation (NLCF) said on Tuesday it has invited tenders for 52,500 tonnes of feed wheat by 11.00 p.m. (0200 GMT) on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>An NLCF official told Reuters that shipment is scheduled for January 25-February 13 if sourced from Canada, Australia and the Pacific Northwest or for January 6-25 if sourced from Europe and the U.S. Gulf.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
